hing YouTube I didn't have cable so  I was really like you know internet kid  and just when I came across your Channel  and I saw what you were doing as far as  like the attic interviews and giving  these essentially faceless people a  voice  um  it resonated with me because that's  something that I wanted to do for like  you know  um addicts but of like not just Asians  but I wanted to highlight the addictions  that Asian people face and that what a  lot of people don't talk about  excellent  Sergio thank you so much for sharing  your story of course I'm glad you're  doing better thank you and stay on track  thank you brother thank you man
 

